":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-6349](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-6349)\r\n### Description\n\nFor #16697, as a short term solution, we will protect multiple calls to `OpenTable` through a barrier approach.\r\n\r\nFor long term, it should be made non-blocking.\r\n\r\n> probably a barrier approach could still lead to all threads getting stuck, as the other N-1 threads would now wait on the mutex instead of on the OpenTable call, so we could still end up in a situation where all threads are stuck…\r\nWe likely would need some light form of async callback instead, to get rid of that problem, where we combine your approach, of one thread goes out and fetches metadata, with some queue, where the other N-1 add some callbacks to a queue, waiting on that metadata to be fetched, but not keep a thread busy.\r\n\r\nThis will be slightly more involving.\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-6349]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-6349?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"h